        {
          "content": "<p><a href=\"http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2022/09/weekly-issue-222.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">四十年编程感想</a>（2022 #222）</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2021/08/weekly-issue-172.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">我们会死于气候灾难吗？</a>（2021 #172）</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2020/08/weekly-issue-122.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">谈谈互联网公司的高估值</a>（2020 #122）</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://www.ruanyifeng.com/blog/2019/09/weekly-issue-72.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">当代人不再有手稿</a>（2019 #72）</p>",
          "links": [
            {
              "text": "四十年编程感想",
